---
description: Decide field-level findings for runCounterparts.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Choose simulated counterpart responses from permitted actions using only that role’s information and preferences. Adapt strategy to the interaction without violating conduct rules, inventing authority, or exposing hidden utility values to the learner. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
